{
  "_about": "The Cleveland Civic Graph design system, as the app uses it today. This file is the one place the look is written down. scripts/design/audit.js fails if the CSS uses a color, type size, radius, or weight that is neither here nor in design/legacy.json, and fails if the phone colors in ext/cxm.css stop matching this file. To change the look on purpose: change it here, change the CSS, run node scripts/design/audit.js --explain, and update the snapshot (DESIGN_UPDATE=1 node scripts/checks/run.js --only design-look). Then read the diff.",
